@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class TCPServer {
  +start(Stage)
  +main(String[])
}
class ChatServer {
  -int port
  -Set<Handler> clients
  +start()
  +stop()
}
class Handler {
  -Socket socket
  -String username
  +run()
  +send(String)
}
class TCPClient {
  +start(Stage)
  +main(String[])
}
class ChatClient {
  -String host
  -int port
  +connect(String, Consumer, Consumer)
  +send(String)
  +close()
}
TCPServer --> ChatServer : controls
ChatServer *-- Handler : concurrent client sessions
TCPClient --> ChatClient : uses
ChatClient ..> ChatServer : TCP over Socket
@enduml
